<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:17.520 --> 00:02:19.370
Mom!

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:43.340
CHAPTER 8

00:02:43.670 --> 00:02:48.070
MENACE! KAGAMI JIJII'S PLOT

00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:56.060
Today, the Ogatas here are going to
teach us about living in the old times.

00:02:56.060 --> 00:02:58.980
As thanks, be sure to
clean up good and proper.

00:02:58.980 --> 00:03:00.730
Yes, sir.

00:03:00.730 --> 00:03:03.520
Now, Ogata-san, thank you in advance.

00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:05.670
Thank you, too.

00:03:08.780 --> 00:03:10.990
Ugh, it's dusty.

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:15.130
Why do we have to do this sort of stuff?

00:03:16.240 --> 00:03:18.800
Thank you for the hard work.

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:23.460
Having you clean out the house is
a real help.

00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:24.980
Oh, it's nothing.

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:29.170
My, look at how shiny
this mirror's become.

00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:32.840
This is my hope chest.

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:37.310
It was originally my mother's hope chest.

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:40.890
But she gave it to me
after I begged her for it.

00:03:40.890 --> 00:03:46.540
Back then, a fine mirror like this
was extremely rare.

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:48.030
Fine?

00:03:48.030 --> 00:03:49.860
You're right.

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:52.170
It's a very beautiful mirror.

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:01.660
Hey, wait up!

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:02.980
Got you!

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:04.550
Take that!

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:07.090
Arimoto! Souma!

00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:08.960
Clean like you're supposed to!

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:11.300
"Clean like you're supposed to!"

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:13.400
You two...

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:15.090
I guess words aren't enough!

00:04:15.090 --> 00:04:18.060
-Inuyama's pissed!
-Run!

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:20.730
-Get back here!
-Whoa, scary!

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:24.440
Ow, ow, ow...

00:04:24.440 --> 00:04:25.350
Watch it.

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:27.650
It's because you chased me!

00:04:27.650 --> 00:04:29.400
You're blaming me?!

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:31.960
It's okay. No one'll know
if we just put it back.

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:35.110
There we go.

00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:36.930
-Let's go.
-Yeah.

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:38.700
That hurt.

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:39.760
You okay?

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:41.590
My butt got cracked.

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:04.390
I'm home.

00:05:04.390 --> 00:05:05.640
Welcome back.

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:08.230
Mom, you're home early today.

00:05:08.230 --> 00:05:11.150
Yes. I've got
a business trip tomorrow, after all.

00:05:11.150 --> 00:05:13.960
I'm making your favorite
Hamburg steak, Mana.

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:15.070
Yay!

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:17.320
Be sure to wash your hands and gargle.

00:05:17.320 --> 00:05:18.970
I know.

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:42.430
Ugh, it's almost exam season. Bummer.

00:05:42.430 --> 00:05:44.660
I haven't done any prep at all.

00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:48.690
The people who say that
are always studying the hardest.

00:05:48.690 --> 00:05:50.500
I wish...

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:53.420
-Well, see you tomorrow.
-Yeah, bye-bye.

00:06:21.850 --> 00:06:24.520
Hey! Oh crap, I'm gonna die!

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:26.290
Jeez, you're bad at this.

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:30.020
You've gotta go around here and...

00:06:30.020 --> 00:06:32.250
Oh, come on! I was about to--

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:42.070
-Yamaguchi.
-Here.

00:06:42.070 --> 00:06:44.660
-Yamamoto.
-Here.

00:06:44.660 --> 00:06:47.810
Huh. It looks like only Arimoto and Souma
are absent.

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:54.760
Excuse me.

00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:59.850
Let's take your temperature, okay?

00:07:07.980 --> 00:07:09.290
Well, Kitaro?

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:12.230
I do sense <i>yokai</i> activity.

00:07:12.230 --> 00:07:13.880
Very strong <i>yokai</i> activity.

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:17.990
We can't leave this alone.
Hurry and find it.

00:07:17.990 --> 00:07:18.800
Right.

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:28.180
-Later.
-Bye-bye.

00:07:44.390 --> 00:07:45.570
Who's there?!

00:08:12.710 --> 00:08:14.510
You're kidding me!

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:18.640
I'm sorry!

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:24.820
Mom!

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:32.280
What's going on?!

00:08:33.770 --> 00:08:36.450
I know. Cat-san...

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:31.180
KITARO AND HIS FRIENDS

00:09:32.040 --> 00:09:35.680
FIGHT WITH KAGAMI-JIJII

00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:34.620
<i>-"Oh no..."
-"No passing."</i>

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:35.620
<i>"You're out!"</i>

00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:44.800
Yum! Ah, delicious!

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:46.510
This is some good <i>sake</i>!

00:09:46.510 --> 00:09:48.930
Huh. Lemme have a sip.

00:09:48.930 --> 00:09:53.430
You sold my <i>sake</i> to earn some change
the other day, didn't you?

00:09:53.430 --> 00:09:55.270
A grudge of <i>sake</i> runs deep!

00:09:55.270 --> 00:09:57.770
Oh come on, don't be so stingy.

00:09:57.770 --> 00:09:59.710
Huh? Where's Kitaro?

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:02.320
Kitaro's gone out.

00:10:02.320 --> 00:10:07.360
The crows were clamoring that powerful
<i>yokai</i> activity had suddenly appeared.

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:08.530
Hmm.

00:10:08.530 --> 00:10:11.680
Catchick, you can have a drink of--

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:13.870
No. You reek of booze.

00:10:13.870 --> 00:10:15.380
Oh.

00:10:18.390 --> 00:10:19.440
HELP!

00:10:25.820 --> 00:10:27.130
Mana?!

00:10:27.130 --> 00:10:29.950
-Kitaro, go quickly!
-Yes!

00:10:33.220 --> 00:10:36.200
Kitaro, it's Mana...

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:38.710
I keep messaging, but she doesn't respond.

00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:38.640
<i>-"Help!"
-"What's wrong, Mana? Message me!"</i>

00:10:49.320 --> 00:10:50.910
It's unlocked...

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:06.600
That's Mana's.

00:11:16.140 --> 00:11:19.540
There's some residual
<i>yokai</i> activity around here...

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:43.480
Mana!

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:45.340
A mirror...

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:49.630
Then the one who attacked Mana-chan
might be Kagami-Jijii.

00:11:49.630 --> 00:11:50.820
Kagami-Jijii?

00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:52.130
Yes.

00:11:52.130 --> 00:11:56.560
But, while he may spy on girls
from inside mirrors,

00:11:56.560 --> 00:12:00.850
he's not the kind of <i>yokai</i> to do
something this brazen...

00:12:00.850 --> 00:12:03.900
What should we do to rescue Mana?

00:12:03.900 --> 00:12:08.210
There must be a mirror that serves as
Kagami-Jijii's home somewhere.

00:12:08.210 --> 00:12:13.200
Without his invitation,
that's the only way to enter mirrors.

00:12:13.200 --> 00:12:16.390
I'll find that mirror. I swear.

00:12:16.390 --> 00:12:22.800
Someone in the GeGeGe Forest
might know Kagami-Jijii well.

00:12:33.550 --> 00:12:34.740
This is...

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:56.180
That's the situation.

00:12:56.180 --> 00:13:00.290
Does anybody know Kagami-Jijii well?

00:13:00.290 --> 00:13:03.640
That sounds like it won't
make a lick of money.

00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:06.500
The two of us go way back.

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:08.360
I know him too.

00:13:08.360 --> 00:13:11.530
Really, Old Man Crybaby, Sand Witch?

00:13:11.530 --> 00:13:15.840
Yeah. But, he's a good-natured fellow.

00:13:15.840 --> 00:13:18.430
I can't imagine he'd do such a thing.

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:22.020
Regardless, I want you to take me
to Kagami-Jijii's place.

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:24.810
All right, in that case I'll... Whoops!

00:13:24.810 --> 00:13:30.230
Don't strain yourself, you drunk.
I'll be your drinking buddy.

00:13:30.230 --> 00:13:32.990
I said I'm not giving you any!

00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:34.630
I'll go.

00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:38.870
After all, I still owe that child
for saving you, Kitaro.

00:13:43.970 --> 00:13:45.980
Don't leave my side!

00:13:50.170 --> 00:13:52.320
-Here...?
-What's wrong?

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:56.970
The crows were talking about the
sudden appearance of huge <i>yokai</i> activity.

00:13:56.970 --> 00:13:59.350
This is the village.

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:06.040
Could Kagami-Jijii be the source
of the <i>yokai</i> activity...?

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:25.350
I think it was somewhere around here...

00:14:25.350 --> 00:14:28.330
Please hurry up and remember.

00:14:28.330 --> 00:14:32.590
It's been decades since
I've last been here.

00:14:32.590 --> 00:14:35.360
The path's changed.

00:14:43.430 --> 00:14:44.940
This way!

00:14:48.250 --> 00:14:52.000
Are you all right, Mana-chan?

00:14:58.220 --> 00:15:01.540
Mana-chan!

00:15:04.410 --> 00:15:07.520
Ah, this is the house.

00:15:15.940 --> 00:15:18.100
So this mirror is...

00:15:29.520 --> 00:15:32.070
So you're Kagami-Jijii.

00:15:32.560 --> 00:15:34.450
Where's Mana?!

00:15:36.360 --> 00:15:38.170
I asked you where she is.

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:43.930
I-I've... got to get to Mana-chan...

00:15:47.790 --> 00:15:49.770
You won't tell us?

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:52.130
I-I was...

00:15:52.620 --> 00:15:55.010
Give Mana back!

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:58.380
Uh... Um, well...

00:15:58.380 --> 00:16:01.860
Why don't you say something, Kagami-Jijii?

00:16:13.290 --> 00:16:16.290
Get out of my way!

00:16:23.990 --> 00:16:25.470
So you want to fight?

00:16:46.350 --> 00:16:48.120
He ran...

00:16:49.560 --> 00:16:51.250
That was Mana's voice!

00:16:51.250 --> 00:16:52.120
Let's go!

00:16:58.460 --> 00:16:59.950
Mana!

00:17:04.490 --> 00:17:09.640
GASHA-DOKURO

00:17:10.240 --> 00:17:12.520
That's a Gasha-Dokuro!

00:17:15.170 --> 00:17:16.770
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:17:23.110 --> 00:17:26.970
Kitaro, Cat-san! You came to rescue me!

00:17:26.970 --> 00:17:28.870
Yeah, but...

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:34.830
What's going on?
Wasn't it Kagami-Jijii who attacked Mana?!

00:17:38.830 --> 00:17:40.290
Save the talk for later!

00:17:40.290 --> 00:17:42.710
Take this! Poison Sand!

00:18:25.940 --> 00:18:27.450
Mana!

00:18:43.820 --> 00:18:44.940
Mana!

00:19:23.980 --> 00:19:25.380
Kitaro, now!

00:19:25.380 --> 00:19:26.640
Right!

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:34.780
Finger Guns!

00:19:52.110 --> 00:19:53.410
Huh?

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:55.760
This is... the hospital?

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:58.500
I see.
So what the crows were talking about

00:19:58.500 --> 00:20:03.580
was the Gasha-Dokuro that awakened
when a tombstone was knocked over.

00:20:03.580 --> 00:20:07.420
The Gasha-Dokuro targeted the humans
that knocked it over.

00:20:07.420 --> 00:20:10.780
-One of them was Mana...
-Yes.

00:20:11.630 --> 00:20:14.280
When I was attacked at home,

00:20:14.280 --> 00:20:19.320
Kagami-Jijii-san took me into the mirror
and saved me.

00:20:25.480 --> 00:20:30.400
I've been protecting Mana-chan
ever since she came here...

00:20:30.400 --> 00:20:35.450
Kagami-Jijii-san stayed with me
even inside the mirror.

00:20:35.450 --> 00:20:38.890
If that's the case, why didn't you say so?

00:20:38.890 --> 00:20:43.510
Because everybody looked so scary...

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:48.000
Honestly, he's as timid as ever.

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:50.170
But it's quite commendable.

00:20:50.170 --> 00:20:54.550
Against a Gasha-Dokuro,
you protected Mana-chan by yourself.

00:20:54.550 --> 00:20:59.900
Th-That's because
sh-she looks like my first love...

00:21:04.140 --> 00:21:08.960
W-Well, whatever your reasons,
you still helped Mana.

00:21:08.960 --> 00:21:10.700
Thank you.

00:21:12.360 --> 00:21:13.400
What?

00:21:13.400 --> 00:21:14.780
You look like her.

00:21:14.780 --> 00:21:15.740
Huh?

00:21:15.740 --> 00:21:17.930
Like my first love...

00:21:17.930 --> 00:21:21.630
Maybe he's just a womanizer...?

00:21:26.630 --> 00:21:30.840
So, Kagami, I hear
you got dumped by Mana-chan.

00:21:30.840 --> 00:21:34.300
Don't laugh at me, you bald Crybaby!

00:21:34.300 --> 00:21:36.430
You're bald too!

00:21:36.430 --> 00:21:40.400
You seem to be having fun.
Perhaps I'll join--

00:21:41.680 --> 00:21:45.060
Then let's see who's the better man!

00:21:45.060 --> 00:21:49.060
Hey, missy! Who's better,
me or this old man?

00:21:49.060 --> 00:21:51.070
I've had enough!

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:55.120
Cat missy!

00:21:56.340 --> 00:21:59.220
She dumped you, she dumped you!

00:22:00.120 --> 00:22:03.040
Kitaro, don't end up like that.

00:22:03.040 --> 00:22:05.140
Yes, Dad.

00:22:06.250 --> 00:22:07.420
<i>oeoeo</i>

00:22:06.250 --> 00:22:07.420
<i>Oeoeo</i>

00:22:07.540 --> 00:22:08.790
<i>oeoeo</i>

00:22:07.540 --> 00:22:08.790
<i>Oeoeo</i>

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:11.460
<i>oeoeoeoeo</i>

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:11.460
<i>Oeoeoeoeo</i>

00:22:11.590 --> 00:22:16.470
<i>mienaimono ni koso shinjitsu ga
arukamo nante</i>

00:22:11.590 --> 00:22:16.470
<i>Perhaps the truth lies
In what you can't see</i>

00:22:16.590 --> 00:22:19.340
<i>kimi wa shinjirukana? me wo tojireba</i>

00:22:16.590 --> 00:22:19.340
<i>Do you believe that?
If you close your eyes</i>

00:22:19.470 --> 00:22:23.930
<i>hajimaruyo atarashii monogatari</i>

00:22:19.470 --> 00:22:23.930
<i>A new story will begin</i>

00:22:24.890 --> 00:22:30.190
<i>taisetsu na mono wa itsudatte</i>

00:22:24.890 --> 00:22:30.190
<i>The really important things</i>

00:22:30.310 --> 00:22:34.990
<i>me niwa mienai monosa</i>

00:22:30.310 --> 00:22:34.990
<i>Are always things you can't see</i>

00:22:35.110 --> 00:22:37.820
<i>namae no nai sora wo miage</i>

00:22:35.110 --> 00:22:37.820
<i>Looking up to a nameless sky</i>

00:22:37.950 --> 00:22:40.950
<i>hiki komogomo yume wo kazoeta</i>

00:22:37.950 --> 00:22:40.950
<i>I bittersweetly counted dreams</i>

00:22:41.070 --> 00:22:43.580
<i>kimi wa jibun ni shoujikikai?</i>

00:22:41.070 --> 00:22:43.580
<i>Are you honest with yourself?</i>

00:22:43.910 --> 00:22:48.500
<i>kaze ga hana wo kusugutta</i>

00:22:43.910 --> 00:22:48.500
<i>The wind tickled my nose</i>

00:22:48.870 --> 00:22:51.540
<i>yamiyo ni magirete oeoeo</i>

00:22:48.870 --> 00:22:51.540
<i>Lost in the dark night, oeoeo</i>

00:22:51.670 --> 00:22:54.300
<i>oeoeo oeoeo</i>

00:22:51.670 --> 00:22:54.300
<i>Oeoeo oeoeo</i>

00:22:54.420 --> 00:22:56.760
<i>kimi no ushiro kara oeoeo</i>

00:22:54.420 --> 00:22:56.760
<i>From behind you, oeoeo</i>

00:22:56.880 --> 00:23:01.680
<i>oeoeo oeoe o o o</i>

00:22:56.880 --> 00:23:01.680
<i>Oeoeo oeoe o o o</i>

00:23:05.970 --> 00:23:10.230
<i>Rat Man's started</i>
<i>a new IT venture using </i>yokai<i>?</i>

00:23:10.650 --> 00:23:13.230
